<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva air cargo traffic down 5.6 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Geneva air cargo traffic down 5.6 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geneva's Cointrin airport handled 5,253 tonnes of air cargo traffic in July, a decrease of 5.6 percent on the same month in 1995, airport authority figures show.</p>
<p>January-July 1996 air cargo traffic at Geneva totalled 37,857 tonnes, down 6.5 percent on 1995 levels.</p>
<p>Postal traffic handled in July increased by 3.1 percent to 698 tonnes, while January-July volume fell by 0.9 percent on the first seven months of 1995 to 5,100 tonnes. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
